<h1>Release notes</h1>
<p>Seed <strong>0.9</strong> adds <code>seed doc</code> and a <a href="docs/lsp.md">language server</a>.</p>
<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
<li><code>m[k]++</code> on a map entry is rejected</li>
<li>crashes in goroutines show <em>where</em> they were spawned
<ol>
<li>with the file</li>
<li>and the line</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>Upgrade with <code>make install</code>.</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code class="language-sh">make &amp;&amp; make install
</code></pre>
